{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to &quot;Drill to the Stars&quot;</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529090/extras/bigBattleF.gif?t=1738938182\" /><br><strong>Roguelike + Strategy + Tower Defense = Drill to the Stars</strong>.<br>No predefined paths for monsters, a unique energy system, procedurally generated maps, various champions and escalation levels, epic boss battles, achievements, and much more await you in the world of &quot;Drill to the Stars.&quot;<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fuel your towers with Steam!</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529090/extras/energyF.gif?t=1738938182\" /><br>Strategic placement is crucial! Carefully assess the terrain and map layout to build your towers where they can harness the most steam from the tiles.<br><strong>The higher the steam, the faster the attack speed</strong>.<br>As towers consume steam from the tiles, you must cleverly piece together your base.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Funnel the monsters through your Base!</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529090/extras/funnelingF.gif?t=1738938182\" /><br>Use walls to guide the monsters as you wish! There are <strong>no predefined paths</strong> on the map, so create your own and lure the monsters into traps! The Tactical Mode assists in planning by showing you the path monsters will take in the next round.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pick your favorite towers!</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529090/extras/draftF.gif?t=1738938182\" /><br>In &quot;Drill to the Stars,&quot; you can select your towers in diverse situations. The tower selection, shop, and game-changing events offer you interesting choices to <strong>optimal adapt to the game situation</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play again!</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529090/extras/mapsF.gif?t=1738938182\" /><br>Through procedural map generation and points of interest, each playthrough brings a new gaming experience. The full version includes <strong>3 maps, 3 champions, 5 different escalation levels, and unlockable content</strong> through achievements.<br>In the world of &quot;Drill to the Stars,&quot; there's a lot to discover.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Geame Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2529090/5c0818da46574ad7636dbab2f6afdb64dc21f394.jpg"},{"name":"Geame Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2529090/b2bf9e0e810cf5d32b4206cc1b787118050d83a1.jpg"},{"name":"Geame Professional","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2529090/600d89e7d385a84a60c6516ce7ca6deb5603f5b4.jpg"},{"name":"Geame Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2529090/7b0ee4e440f4e83d08eb5140227bf8574ce6b3fc.jpg"},{"name":"Geamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2529090/98fc55408b6069a9cf5f3e62f5540087e058a602.jpg"},{"name":"Constructor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2529090/218190c55d503c7f8fa37fcb43b3edbcacdd7824.jpg"},{"name":"False Constructor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2529090/eb39abad630532d3d10dff85492778b062d0f000.jpg"},{"name":"Master Constructor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2529090/41b52bbfb3c984ee8936ecc25b7636a85041d235.jpg"},{"name":"Alchemist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2529090/82232e1bcbb506812f7f48d42f28a460b3308ee7.jpg"},{"name":"False Alchemist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2529090/77367cc00922f83